<title>USA: NL Industries declines comment on stock.</title>
<headline>NL Industries declines comment on stock.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Friday that in had asked NL Industries Inc if there were any corporate developments which would explain the unusual market activity of its stock.</p>
<p>The exchange said that NL told it that its policy was not to comment on unusual market activity or rumors.</p>
<p>NL Industries stock closed May 2 at 11-5/8, up 2-1/8 from the previous day's close of 9-1/2.</p>
